sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Frontend as React 19 Frontend (TanStack)
    participant Gateway as FastAPI Router (/api/verify)
    participant Retriever as Hybrid Multi-Source Retriever
    participant Ensemble as Ensemble Verification Engine
    participant DeBERTa as DeBERTa-v3 NLI Model
    participant Embeddings as all-MiniLM-L6-v2 Embedder
    participant KG as KG Triples Extractor
    participant DB as MongoDB Atlas / In-Memory Store

    User->>Frontend: Enter Claim ("The Earth orbits the Sun")
    Frontend->>Gateway: POST /api/verify { claim, methods: ["cross_encoder", "semantic_similarity"] }
    
    alt Evidence not provided
        Gateway->>Retriever: retrieve_evidence(query="The Earth orbits the Sun")
        Retriever->>Retriever: Query Wikipedia / arXiv / Local DB
        Retriever->>Retriever: Reciprocal Rank Fusion & Cross-Encoder Reranking
        Retriever-->>Gateway: Return Top-K Evidence Passages
    end

    Gateway->>Ensemble: evaluate(claim, evidence, methods)
    
    par Parallel Stance & Uncertainty Evaluation
        Ensemble->>DeBERTa: predict_stance(claim, evidence)
        DeBERTa-->>Ensemble: Entailment: 0.96, Contradiction: 0.01, Neutral: 0.03
    and
        Ensemble->>Embeddings: compute_similarity(claim, evidence)
        Embeddings-->>Ensemble: Cosine Similarity: 0.89
    end

    Ensemble->>Ensemble: Fuse Stance Probabilities & Calibrate Confidence
    Ensemble-->>Gateway: Verdict: SUPPORTED, Confidence: 0.94, Hallucinated: False

    Gateway->>KG: extract_knowledge_graph(claim, evidence)
    KG-->>Gateway: Nodes: ["Earth", "Sun", "Orbit"], Edges: [...]

    Gateway->>DB: save_verification(record)
    DB-->>Gateway: Acknowledge (Saved)

    Gateway-->>Frontend: JSON Response { verdict, confidence, is_hallucinated, kg, sources }
    Frontend->>Frontend: Render VerdictBadge ("Supported"), ConfidenceBar, Citations & React Flow Graph
    Frontend-->>User: Display Verified Results
